  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nGiven equation : 8 × 4 - 3 + 57 ÷ 9 = 42\n\nNow, by interchanging the numbers :-\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 8 and 4\n\n8 × 4 - 3 + 57 ÷ 9 = 42 ⇒ 4 × 8 - 3 + 57 ÷ 9 = 42\n\n4 × 8 - 3 + **57 ÷ 9**__ = 42\n\n__**4**____** × 8**__ - 3 + 6.33 = 42\n\n__**36 + 6.33**__ - 3 = 42\n\n__**42.33 - 3**__ = 42\n\n39.33 ≠ 42 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 3 and 9​\n\n8 × 4 - 3 + 57 ÷ 9 = 42 ⇒ 8 × 4 - 9 + 57 ÷ 3 = 42\n\n8 × 4 - 9 + **57 ÷ 3**__ = 42\n\n__**8 × 4**__ - 9 + 19 = 42\n\n__**32 + 19**__ - 9 = 42\n\n__**51 - 9**__ = 42\n\n42 = 42 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 57 and 9 \n\n8 × 4 - 3 + 57 ÷ 9 = 42 ⇒ 8 × 4 - 3 + 9 ÷ 57 = 42\n\n8 × 4 - 3 + **9**____** ÷ 57**__ = 42\n\n__**8 × 4**__ - 3 + 0.15 = 42\n\n__**32 + 0.15**__ - 3 = 42\n\n__**32.15 - 3**__ = 42\n\n29.15 ≠ 42 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 42 and 57\n\n8 × 4 - 3 + 57 ÷ 9 = 42 ⇒ 8 × 4 - 3 + 42 ÷ 9 = 57\n\n8 × 4 - 3 + **42**____** ÷ 9**__ = 57\n\n__**8 × 4**__ - 3 + 4.67 = 57\n\n__**32 + 4.67**__ - 3 = 57\n\n__**36.67 - 3**__ = 57\n\n33.67 ≠ 57 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (2)\" is the correct answer.",
